    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/thephotostick/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=628182914604991075&sectionId=628182914689073763)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpah84uQ0b_text","label":"ggpah84uQ0b_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">By the time my kids were old enough to appreciate them, I had already filled shelves with scrapbooks.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Birthday parties. Family vacations. First days of school. Christmas mornings.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I've always been the memory keeper in my family.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I'm the one who prints the photos, labels the albums, and saves every little moment because I know how quickly time passes.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">But a few months ago, <strong>something happened that completely changed the way I think about preserving memories.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaLjpcMARz_text","label":"ggaLjpcMARz_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>The Day I Realized My Memories Weren't Actually Safe</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEpH-rYk-J_text","label":"ggEpH-rYk-J_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">One of my old phones suddenly stopped working.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">At first, I wasn't worried. Surely my photos were backed up somewhere… right?</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><i><strong>Wrong.</strong></i></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Years of pictures and videos were simply gone.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Some of them I had already printed and added to my scrapbooks, but many of them were still sitting on that device, waiting for me to print them someday.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I lost family vacations, candid moments, and everyday memories that can never be recreated.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I was heartbroken.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg13DkAKWzH_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg13DkAKWzH_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T103034.754.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCeGi_dxdJ_text","label":"ggCeGi_dxdJ_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I had spent years carefully preserving memories for my family, yet <strong>I hadn't done enough to protect the digital photos</strong> that mattered just as much.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8Pv9VtE3K_text","label":"gg8Pv9VtE3K_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Then I Found ThePhotoStick® Omni</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVPSVfIsqo_text","label":"ggVPSVfIsqo_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I immediately started looking for a way to protect the thousands of photos and videos scattered across my phone, tablet, and computer.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Normal USB drives only work with my computer, not my portable devices, and cloud services are way too expensive (I shouldn’t have to pay for MY memories!)</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I needed something that would help me protect the memories no matter where they were stored.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">That's when I discovered </span><a href=\"http://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2kcpiQdtX_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg2kcpiQdtX_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Marsha_Holding_Unit_Wide.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVuiYyCpKI_text","label":"ggVuiYyCpKI_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And honestly? It felt like a huge weight had been lifted off my shoulders.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>ThePhotoStick Omni helps me back up and organize my photos and videos from all my devices</strong> in one convenient place.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No complicated setup.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No monthly fees.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No worrying about where my memories are stored.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Just <strong>a simple way to protect the moments that mean the most</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkBY88em1h_text","label":"ggkBY88em1h_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>A Backup Solution Made for Memory Keepers</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggE1CRaGO1n_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggE1CRaGO1n_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T104507.512.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGTbMUEkXW_text","label":"ggGTbMUEkXW_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">As someone who loves scrapbooking, I have thousands of photos that haven't made it into albums yet.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Now, I don't have to panic every time my phone storage gets full or wonder what would happen if a device stopped working.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I know my digital memories are protected.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And that peace of mind is priceless.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg62-SJsX0F_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg62-SJsX0F_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T112556.339.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQ5Dp_czZe_text","label":"ggQ5Dp_czZe_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>To use </strong></span><a href=\"http://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>, just follow these three easy steps:</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Step One:</strong> Download the FREE app from the Google Play Store or the App Store.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Step Two:</strong> Plug ThePhotoStick Omni into your device. Once connected, it will automatically begin finding and backing up all your photos, videos, and other files.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Step Three:</strong> Once your backup has completed, disconnect 